  "rationale": "91 units of Paneer 400G at Dark store 10 (East Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the online sell-by deadline on 2026-09-23; doing nothing writes off ₹16965 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹12244. This play uses a bundle with SKU-MULTIGRAIN-BREAD-400G at ₹275 for 317 consented customers (Tea connoisseurs, Dairy occasionals, Sweets occasionals, Everyday staples shoppers, Festival sweets loyalists, Personal care regulars): expected 30 units, margin ₹698, discount cost ₹1052, waste avoided ₹5602 (CI 2 to 88 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs Paneer 400G with Multigrain Bread 400G at a bundle price of 275 INR, which satisfies the 8% dairy margin floor while adhering to the policy preference for bundles over markdowns. It targets all consented customers across the candidate segments to maximize reach and clear the online sell-by risk.",
